<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC agreement &quot;the best that we could do&quot; - Iran.</title>
<headline>OPEC agreement &quot;the best that we could do&quot; - Iran.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian oil minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh said Thursday's OPEC agreement to rollover output for six months &quot;was the best that we could do.&quot;</p>
<p>Aghazadeh was speaking to reporters before leaving Vienna.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
